# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# ESC current, ESC telemetry and DShot300 (jumper JP3 on, overlay-esc.dat).
# Load after 30- and 50-: it switches the four outputs from PWM to DShot.
# Needs a HAL release with DShot output; HAL v0.1.1 does not have it.
# Not yet tested with a real ESC: see the README.

# Main battery: voltage on D2 + current on D9 (analog pin 9, ESC CURR).
BATT_MONITOR 4
BATT_CURR_PIN 9
# Set BATT_AMP_PERVLT and BATT_AMP_OFFSET from your ESC's data,
# then check both against a meter.

# Second monitor: ESC serial telemetry on J5 pin 2 (SERIAL3).
# Display and logging only; the failsafe stays on the main battery.
BATT2_MONITOR 9

# DShot300: telemetry requests need DShot.
MOT_PWM_TYPE 5
SERVO_BLH_AUTO 1
SERVO_BLH_TRATE 10
# Motor pole count; 14 is common, check your motors.
SERVO_BLH_POLES 14
